 these  monsters in the race for game of the  month of May 2015 you can nitpick the  specifics but it's hard to deny that the  witcher 3 wild hunt is a  great accomplishment garol The Witcher  of the game's title is a stoic presence  in an unwelcome world as he navigates  one of gaming's most exquisitely crafted  lands he witnesses couples finding love  amid horror and politicians enduring the  turbulence of unhappy citizens choice  and consequence come to have great  meaning as you alter the course of  people's lives all while galloping  across mysterious bogs and battling  ferocious inspiring monsters no game has  it all but the witcher 3 wild hunt has  an air of totality giving you everything  you might want in an open-air RPG  feeling simultaneously enormous and  intimate creating personal connections  and kingdoms that stretch on for many  miles congratulations The Witcher 3 for  inspiring in us a great urge to explore  and for earning gamespot's award for  game of the month of May 2015
 

